k #AI #OpenSourceAI \n\nGitHub｜推理代码与使用说明：\n\nhttps://t.co/EWXRrV7jd8\n\nHugging Face｜模型权重：\n\nhttps://t.co/sDbZLjK063\n\n技术报告：\n\nhttps://t.co/dk4YcnJbzW","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113561067372908779"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113559268461006848"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T09:13:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113559303626149954"],"id":"2113559303626149954","in_reply_to_user_id":"1764818331822182400","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3173,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113559301570916713","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"应用场景：\n\n机器狗、无人车或者边缘硬件的内存是有限且固定的，还要分给摄像头看路、雷达感知和电机控制\n\n根本承受不起大模型在半路“胃口大开”突然吃光内存\n\nEdgeRock 正好解决了这一痛点\n\n详细内容：https://t.co/2pZd2n7er7 https://t.co/iYHRGuJYJH","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113559303626149954"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113558609917534208"]},"created_at":"2026-10-23T09:13:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113559301570916713"],"id":"2113559301570916713","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":8003,"like_count":28,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":29,"retweet_count":3},"text":"AI推理越长，显存越吃紧？\n\nEdgeRock 提供了一种新的解法...\n\n普通大模型在进行长文本或复杂推理时，要写很长的推导\n\n它通常会把前文处理过的信息暂存在 GPU 的工作空间里，这个空间叫“显存”。推导越长，这部分信息占的显存空间就会越来越大\n\nEdgeRock-4B 打破了这一规律： https://t.co/QhIztsnKR4","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2113559301570916713"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2113217319560482816"]},"created_at":"2026-10-22T10:41:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113219196251439208"],"id":"2113219196251439208","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":24,"impression_count":9050,"like_count":50,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":38,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112748049609158836","type":"quoted"}],"text":"新一期 XiaoHu AI日报来了\n\n调整了下节奏\n优化了开头、结尾\n滚动字幕改为了，除播报新闻以外的其他新闻\n\n目前还没解决的问题：\n\n口型同步本地化\n声音克隆更像真人\n\n这周不出差，下一版本解决这俩问题，同时升级为自动化制作和搞个真人版本，还有增加其他风格、多语言、手机竖屏版本 https://t.co/rPRTZHIyba https://t.co/tW3V9XJoCO","url":"https://x.com/i/status/211321